abstract: >-
  Analysis code, derived analytical data sets, pooled posterior summaries and
  REML result objects reproducing every value reported in a study of morphological change in 73
  Atlantic Forest passerine species across 24 years (1995-2018) of regional
  warming, using ATLANTIC BIRD TRAITS. Code is MIT licensed; data, results and
  text are CC BY 4.0, except one transcribed third-party table (CC BY-NC 4.0).
  See LICENSE and LICENSE-DATA.md.
